  lines:
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 7ce02c1f8c657064e91da607aebe315a, type: 2}
    emotion: 3
    text: " \u2026So she was never here. I knew that\u2026 didn\u2019t I? I just
      didn\u2019t want to be the one to say goodbye."
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 7ce02c1f8c657064e91da607aebe315a, type: 2}
    emotion: 3
    text: " I thought if I came here\u2026 if I played it right\u2026 I could fix
      it. Like I could go back and be there when it mattered."
